-Ikhlaas</a> › Âyet 3</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Al-Ikhlaas 112:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Doğurmamıştır, doğurulmamıştır.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فاسمه (الأحد دل على نفي المشاركة والمماثلة واسمه (الصمد دل على أنه مستحق لجميع صفات الكمال<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/107</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s112a3\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/112-2.html\">Önceki âyet (112:2)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/112-4.html\">Sonraki âyet (112:4)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/112-4.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Al-Ikhlaas 112:4 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"O&#x27;nun hiçbir dengi yoktur.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/112-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/112-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/112-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/112-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.co